---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Illustrative heap usage over time comparing three GC pacing regimes inside a 512 MiB pod
// (Live baseline = 50 MiB, GOMEMLIMIT = 400 MiB):
//   1. GOGC=100 (triggers every 100 MiB -> frequent GC, wastes ~300 MiB idle RAM)
//   2. GOGC=400 + GOMEMLIMIT=400 MiB (triggers at 250 MiB -> ~4x fewer GC cycles, safe margin)
//   3. Live heap approaches GOMEMLIMIT -> back-to-back GC cycles capped at 50% CPU
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
const x0 = 84;
const x1 = 875;
const yTop = 44;
const yBot = 250; // 0 MiB
// Scale: 512 MiB -> y=54, 400 MiB -> y=98, 250 MiB -> y=156, 100 MiB -> y=212, 50 MiB -> y=231
---
<figure class="gp16g">
  <div class="gp16g-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Memory pacing chart in a 512 MiB pod: GOGC=100 collects frequently at 100 MiB; GOGC=400 with GOMEMLIMIT=400 MiB lets heap reach 250 MiB for four times fewer GC cycles; when live data approaches GOMEMLIMIT, GC triggers continuously up to the 50% CPU cap.">
    {/* Y axis and horizontal gridlines */}
    <line x1={x0} x2={x0} y1={yTop - 8} y2={yBot} class="axis" />
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1={yBot} y2={yBot} class="axis" />

    {/* 512 MiB pod OOM ceiling */}
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1="54" y2="54" class="oomline" />
    <text x={x0 - 8} y="58" text-anchor="end" class="r num">512 MiB</text>
    <DiagramIcon name="kubernetes" x={700} y={37} size={26} />
    <text x={x1 - 4} y="42" text-anchor="end" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Pod limit (OOMKill)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Trần pod (OOMKill)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* 400 MiB GOMEMLIMIT */}
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1="98" y2="98" class="limitline" />
    <text x={x0 - 8} y="102" text-anchor="end" class="b num">400 MiB</text>
    <text x={x0 + 8} y="88" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>GOMEMLIMIT = 400 MiB (~80% soft cap)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>GOMEMLIMIT = 400 MiB (trần mềm ~80%)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* 250 MiB line */}
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1="156" y2="156" class="grid" />
    <text x={x0 - 8} y="160" text-anchor="end" class="m num">250 MiB</text>

    {/* 100 MiB line */}
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1="212" y2="212" class="grid" />
    <text x={x0 - 8} y="216" text-anchor="end" class="m num">100 MiB</text>

    {/* 50 MiB live baseline */}
    <text x={x0 - 8} y="236" text-anchor="end" class="m num">50 MiB</text>

    {/* Regime 1: GOGC=100 sawtooth (x: 92..310) */}
    <polyline points="92,231 124,212 126,231 158,212 160,231 192,212 194,231 226,212 228,231 260,212 262,231 294,212 296,231" class="saw1" />
    <DiagramIcon name="gc" x={140} y={191} size={26} />
    <text x="195" y="196" text-anchor="middle" class="b">GOGC=100</text>
    <text x="195" y="272" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Frequent GC, 300 MiB RAM idle</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>GC dày, bỏ trống ~300 MiB RAM</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Regime 2: GOGC=400 + GOMEMLIMIT (x: 330..610) */}
    <polyline points="330,231 455,156 458,231 583,156 586,231" class="saw2" />
    <DiagramIcon name="gc" x={364} y={133} size={26} />
    <text x="458" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>GOGC=400 + GOMEMLIMIT</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>GOGC=400 + GOMEMLIMIT</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="458" y="272" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4x fewer GC cycles, safe margin</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ít vòng GC hơn 4 lần, dư biên an toàn</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Regime 3: Live heap crowds GOMEMLIMIT -> thrashing (x: 635..865) */}
    <rect x="635" y="98" width="232" height="152" class="thrashbg" />
    <polyline points="635,231 660,112 670,118 682,100 690,108 704,99 712,107 726,99 734,107 748,99 756,107 770,99 778,107 792,99 800,107 814,99 822,107 836,99" class="sawred fm-pulse" />
    <DiagramIcon name="throttle" x={684} y={133} size={26} />
    <text x="750" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Thrashing zone</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vùng GC quay cuồng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="750" y="272" text-anchor="middle" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Live near 400 MiB: 50% GC CPU cap</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Sát trần 400 MiB: hãm 50% CPU GC</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x={x0} y="298" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Heap curve for 50 MiB steady live heap (GOGC=100 vs 400) followed by a live spike hitting GOMEMLIMIT.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đường heap với 50 MiB dữ liệu sống (GOGC=100 vs 400) và pha dữ liệu sống tăng chạm ngưỡng GOMEMLIMIT.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Raising <code>GOGC</code> alongside a <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> cap lets Go trade idle pod RAM for fewer GC cycles, while keeping ~15–20% headroom below the container limit prevents OOM kills and GC CPU thrashing.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tăng <code>GOGC</code> kèm trần mềm <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> giúp tận dụng RAM nhàn rỗi của pod để giảm số lần chạy GC, đồng thời chừa biên an toàn 15–20% dưới ngưỡng pod để tránh cả OOMKill lẫn vòng xoáy đốt 50% CPU của GC.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp16g { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp16g-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp16g svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp16g text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp16g .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16g .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp16g .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp16g .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp16g .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16g .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp16g .oomline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gp16g .limitline { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .gp16g .saw1 { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .gp16g .saw2 { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; }
  .gp16g .sawred { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .gp16g .thrashbg { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); opacity: 0.45; }
  .gp16g figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
